WEBVTT

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.480
Can you see land yet?

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.250
I can't see it yet!

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.990
Have the heavens forsaken us?

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.460
Captain, look!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.460
Oh!

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.690
That's...

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:41.300
Tadah! And that is how the legendary
Faros Lighthouses were discovered.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:50.210
Later, we discovered the road to Comodo and Cocomo Beach,

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:53.380
located west of the Sogrado Desert.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:09.600
That's today's Deforte Ragnarok lesson on the Faros Lighthouses,

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.330
presented by Kapra Service.

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:18.770
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.250
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:29.750
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:35.560
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:39.490
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:47.600
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:54.910
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:00.450
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:07.580
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:13.060
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.500
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:22.440
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.710
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:28.780
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:31.280
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:35.820
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:41.620
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.530
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.980
The sea breeze feels so good...

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:04.010
Those are the Faros Lighthouses...

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:07.310
So those are the legendary lighthouses...

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:21.230
Poring...

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:22.990
<i>Maaya-chan...</i>

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:33.010
Poring!

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.340
Alice-<i>chan!</i>

00:03:49.990 --> 00:03:54.400
Maaya-<i>chan</i>, let's get off...

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:59.100
The other passengers have all disembarked.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.040
Poring...

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.980
Um... Excuse me...

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:09.910
This ship will be heading back for Alberta.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:12.650
Return passengers will be boarding,

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.520
so we'd like to ask you to disembark quickly.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.250
All right.

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:19.890
Come on, Maaya-<i>chan...</i>
Let's go. Please?

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.060
Maaya, stand up.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.650
If we don't get off, we'll be causing an inconvenience.

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:29.930
What happened, anyway?

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.990
Well...

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:36.770
By the time we found her at the park...

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.840
Poring...

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:43.280
Poring... Poring!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.010
Maaya-<i>chan</i>!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:50.250
Maaya-<i>chan</i>, what's the matter?

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.690
Poring! Poring!

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.160
What should we do?

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.460
What do you mean?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.640
We can't take her to
Comodo like this...

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.400
What?

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:13.680
Well, you know... she seems depressed, and...

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.680
Poring.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:18.150
If she's not feeling well,

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:20.780
it might be best to leave her behind and not force her to come.

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:23.080
What?!

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.480
Hold it right there!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:30.320
That's a terribly cruel thing to tell a traveling companion!

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:33.630
It was just that I...

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:35.320
Just that you what?!

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:42.670
If I were stronger, this never would have happened to Maaya.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.330
What?

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:48.940
That's why...

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:52.450
That's why I have to become stronger!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:56.420
To do that, I need to reach Comodo quickly.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:59.850
Young man, I think you're missing the point.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.960
I don't care what you say, Roan.
I'm taking Maaya-<i>chan</i> with us.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.100
Let's all go together, Maaya-<i>chan.</i>

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.630
Together... together...

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.300
--Together...
--Together...

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:17.800
You and Ma-<i>chan</i> will always be together...

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.310
Alice-<i>chan...</i>

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:33.650
Maaya-<i>chan...</i>

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:35.650
What's the matter, Maaya-<i>chan</i>?

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.650
Stop it!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:45.870
Are you all right, Maaya-<i>chan</i>?

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.100
Maaya-<i>chan...</i>

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:50.000
Maaya-<i>chan</i>, get a grip on yourself!

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:01.610
Women... they can be such trouble...

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.620
They don't understand a guy's way of showing kindness.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:25.210
He doesn't understand women at all...

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.070
Well, I guess that's to be expected...

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.310
He's still a kid.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:36.780
Cheer up...

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:38.520
Poring!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.460
Please?

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:45.230
Go back to being the old Maaya-<i>chan</i> we all know.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.320
Poring.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:57.510
Yuufa...

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.670
over here...

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:00.670
Big Brother?

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.620
Yuufa...

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:17.360
My dear sister, Yuufa... come to me...

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.790
Big Brother!

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:21.290
Big Brother Keough!

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:28.340
I missed you so, Yuufa.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:29.970
Keough!

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:31.300
Keough?!

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:35.740
It's him...

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.300
Big Brother!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.310
Not you.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.270
Iruga, no!

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:00.330
We're more than a match for these monsters.

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:12.280
Double Strafing!

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.280
Yuufa!

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.790
Poring.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.630
Sad?

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.060
Poring!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:34.670
You look as if you're carrying all the world's misfortunes on your shoulders.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:37.370
You humans are all like that.

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:41.010
You act as though you're the most unfortunate of all.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:45.950
You're the cruelest beings on this earth.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:51.320
If you're going to curse anyone, curse the fact that you're a human!

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:54.320
Tsk...

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.930
Big Brother!

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:06.430
Humans brought it all upon themselves...

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:10.570
Sadness and suffering eventually turn into hatred.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:15.340
It is only natural that hatred turns into revenge...

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:20.010
Humans are to blame for everything.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:24.390
Big Brother, what are you talking about?

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:29.620
Why do your companions suffer so?

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:34.360
It's because they were betrayed by people they trusted!

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:40.400
So tell me...

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.500
How does it feel...

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:46.440
...to have killed Alice with your own hands?

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.880
You said Alice was your friend,

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:51.310
but when I turned Alice into an ugly monster,

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.850
you showed your true nature.

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:59.620
...when I turned Alice into an ugly monster...

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:06.830
You... You did that to Alice, didn't you?

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:10.800
She was my precious friend...

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.530
What're you talking about?

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:16.990
What did you do to her with your own hands?

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.280
No...

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:31.680
Nooo!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:39.060
Monsters and Humans cannot exist together.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:44.870
We exist to detest, to hate, one another.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.070
You're wrong!

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:48.870
You're wrong! You're wrong!

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:53.140
What do you know?

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:55.040
This pain I feel...

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.710
can only be understood by one who has been betrayed!

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:27.500
Holy Cross!

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:35.350
Arrow Shower!

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:47.020
Oh no!

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:55.370
Judia-<i>san</i>, I'm coming!

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.300
Judia-<i>san</i>!

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.020
Iruga!

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.480
Sonic...

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.480
...Blow!

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:34.000
They keep coming and coming!

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:45.010
Envenom.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.520
Envenom?

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:51.680
Poison?

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:54.600
How brutal...

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.360
Iruga used... poison?

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.960
Blitz Heat!

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:12.010
What're you waiting for?!

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:15.150
Give Iruga support!

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:16.520
Okay!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.360
Yes, Humans are at fault...

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.530
Humans deceive without a second thought...

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.690
and commit betrayal.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:32.500
From the very start, there was no friendship between you and Alice.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:37.710
Hatred is all that exists between Humans and Monsters.

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:41.340
In order to break the chains of hatred,

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:46.550
the root of the animosity- humans- must be destroyed.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:50.150
Humans have no such thing as love.

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:52.020
They are creatures whose lives have no value,

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:54.920
that deserve to be destroyed.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:56.990
That's not so!

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.560
That's not so at all!

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.960
Can you still say that after this?

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:14.510
I became like this, because you and the others forsook me!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:19.210
My hatred for you and others was what kept me alive.

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:23.310
You, yourselves, are the ones who sowed the seeds of misfortune!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.930
Maybe... you're right...

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:32.330
You're wrong!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:37.830
Alice and I weren't
Human and Monster!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.940
There was no hatred.

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:44.440
We were friends...

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:46.340
Anybody, once they open up their heart can...

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.000
Silence, girl!

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:00.520
Can you still say that, now?!

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.960
Poring!

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:17.570
You see!

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:19.970
Run... Run!

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.410
I'm sorry....

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:29.080
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry!

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:31.790
My poor, dear little sister...

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:34.980
You need not cry anymore.

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:40.820
I will forgive everything...

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:45.470
Big Brother Keough...

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:47.030
Yuufa!

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:50.200
Roan!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:54.340
We've defeated all the monsters.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:17:01.450
Keough, I'll be your opponent.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.280
That suits me fine, Iruga.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.630
You can't beat me in your condition.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.300
I'll end it now!

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:33.640
Iruga!

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:35.980
Keough!

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:45.830
Kyrie eleison!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:51.990
What the-

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:02.940
Sanctuary!

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.090
Yuufa!

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.450
You can't be serious?!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.950
Why're you saving someone like him?!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.290
I...

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:26.960
Wait!

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:30.300
Are you going to run away?!
Come back here!

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:46.050
Oh, what's the matter?

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:49.650
Why don't you try becoming friends with them, as well!

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:12.280
Poring.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.910
Alice-<i>chan...</i>

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.310
Poring.

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:57.860
Poi-Poi.

00:19:57.860 --> 00:19:59.660
Poring.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:09.300
Poi-Poi, if I die, do you think
I can go where Alice-<i>chan</i> is?

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.070
Poring!

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:15.340
If I can live together with Alice-<i>chan...</i>

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.520
It's... okay.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:23.680
Poring! Poring!

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:33.360
Okay, playtime's over.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.370
Th-This place is...

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:57.050
Poring?

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:16.170
Poring...

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:17.660
Poi-Poi...

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.330
Poi-poi!

00:21:54.510 --> 00:21:57.380
Alice-<i>chan</i>... I'm so sorry!

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:01.420
Alice-<i>chan</i>!

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.320
Poring...

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:17.660
Mama...

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:23.330
Mama!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way to</i> <i>regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:32.870
<i>This is Biito.</i>

00:23:32.870 --> 00:23:35.010
<i>The dark caverns leading to Comodo</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:37.340
<i>cast a shadow on the souls</i> <i>of Roan and the others.</i>

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:39.950
<i>Next time,</i> "I Need You."

00:23:39.950 --> 00:23:42.620
<i>I-I want to hear that</i> <i>at least once in my life...</i>

00:23:42.620 --> 00:23:44.850
<i>But not from you!</i>
